Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Implement scale-aware fixed-tile redraw and layout
 optimizations

- Introduce browser_get_tile_size() utility for scale-aware tiles (256px standard, 512px High-DPI).
- Update BeOS frontend to use dynamic tile size in its redraw loop.
- Implement fixed-tile redraw strategy in the Windows frontend (nsws_drawable_paint).
- Optimize box_mark_dirty to skip redundant flag propagation for already-dirty subtrees.
- Ensure consistent coordinate alignment for tiles across frontends.

