Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 11:17:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Unify fixed-tile redraw strategy and optimize incremental
 layout

- Implement scale-aware fixed-tile redraw (256x256 for standard, 512x512 for High-DPI) across all major frontends (Windows, GTK, Qt, BeOS, Monkey).
- Optimize `box_mark_dirty` to avoid redundant dirty list additions when an ancestor is already dirty.
- Verify consistent use of `DIRTY_INTRINSIC`, `CHILD_DIRTY`, and `DIRTY_LAYOUT` flags to skip redundant reflows for stable subtrees.
- Ensure old and new bounding boxes are captured for dirty elements to guarantee correct screen clearing and redrawing.
- Document progress in `AUDIT_REPORT.md` and `CODE_AUDIT_2026.md`.

